{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Soothing Pro 是一款專為提升睡眠質素、減壓及增強專注力而設計的智能音頻應用。它提供豐富的自然聲景、引導冥想、白噪音及 ASMR 內容，讓用戶在喧囂世界中建立寧靜的個人空間。目前該 App 於 App Store 限時免費下載，是改善身心健康的高性價比選擇。</p>\n\n<h2>自由混音定製專屬放鬆環境</h2>\n<p>App 核心功能在於強大的自定義聲音混音系統，用戶可將雨聲、鋼琴旋律、森林鳥鳴或白噪音等多種音效層疊組合，創造獨一無二的背景音樂。配合專業設計的呼吸練習指引、睡眠計時器及離線聆聽模式，能精準調節節奏與音量，幫助用戶快速進入深度睡眠狀態或在工作和學習中保持心流體驗，實現真正以人為本的身心平衡。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Soothing Pro: Calm &amp; Sleep</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T16:02:06.034954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}